  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You knit auras together to conjoin fates.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Fate Link<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the save DC for a creature to resist the Fate Link. Willing participants in a Fate Link can absorb a harmful condition from another linked creature as a free action, and mythic creatures can expend uses of mythic power interchangeably with points from a ki pool, allowing mythic creatures without a ki pool to absorb harmful conditions from another linked creature.</p>\n<p>If you expend one use of mythic power when establishing the Fate Link, it functions as mythic shield other.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
